omx-clap-host (0.31.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * packaging: the CLAP headers with a floor and a ceiling
  * tests: the host-verbs check drives monitor_output_off
  * omx-contract's floor is 3.11.0, the release this one is built and tested
    with
  * ci: plugin-hostd at the commit that takes plugin-hostd-protocol 0.5
  * README: refresh apt after adding the repository, download into /tmp
  * fuzz corpus and docs follow the codes' sentences
  * contract: data/ read back through omx-contract 3.11.0, the renders carry
    the codes' sentences
  * Release 0.31.0
  * omx-dsp is taken at 0.32, plugin-hostd-protocol at 0.5 and plugin-db at
    0.3
  * data: text and args for every owned code, omx-contract floor 3.11.0
  * tests: every owned code needs text in en and ca
  * core: omx_clap_host_meter_values reads a clip meter's word too
  * docs: meters, the plugin holds and the reader recovers
  * host: held meters are read at omx-dsp's host read rate, a monitor can be
    stopped
  * omx-clap-host answers curve_bind and curve_points through the protocol
    library's hook

